      "label": "Team Ownership Model (is_owner / is_player)",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "agent_docs/use_cases/4Sports_UC_Bloque3_EquiposJugadores.md",
      "source_location": "Modelo de roles",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Ownership and roster presence are dimensions independent of the visible role: is_owner (exactly 1 per team, enforced by partial unique index) grants exclusive privileges; is_player controls roster/convocatoria inclusion. Lets a coach own the team without appearing in lineups."
